window.products.push({"id":636047,"name":"NiHome 24-Pair Shoe Organizer Cabinet with Doors, Top Shelf and Expandable, Stackable, Free-Standing Design - Ideal for Entryway, Closet, Garage, Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7178AJiOoSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️【Multifunctional Storage Organizer】Instead of embarrassing dirty piles all over the place, you’ll enjoy a well-organized home with this shoe rack! Accommodating up to 24 pairs of adult shoes, this footwear storage box provides plenty of space not only for organizing and displaying shoes, but also for sundries, toys, plants, books, handbags and other items. Excellent size for your foyer, hallway, living room, wardrobe, closet, dormitory, terrace, cabinet, garage, garden and more. Color: Black. ✔️【DIY Design】Combining versatility and simplicity, this portable cube storage fits any home décor and adds a stylish touch to your room. The rack can be customized to meet your specific requirements, and the open shelf at the top provides additional storage space, so you can store more items without worrying about them falling off. The adjustable dividers can be removed to accommodate boots, high heels, or other larger accessories. ✔️【Premium Construction】This modern shoe storage rack features PP plastic panels with metal frames and ABS connectors. Sturdy plastic connectors ensure durability and stability, and improved load bearing capacity makes it suitable for large and heavy objects. Dust-resistant and waterproof PP plastic panels are easy to clean and will keep your shoes away from dirt. The transparent door design allows you to quickly find shoes. With excellent reliability, this shoe organizer is perfect for your everyday organization. ✔️【Easy to Care】The footwear storage shelf is made of healthy, non-toxic and environmentally friendly plastic that is sturdy and durable. The shoe rack panels are made of high-quality PP plastic material that has good waterproof properties and can be cleaned with water. Door holes are designed for air circulation to prevent odor build-up. It will neatly organize your ever-expanding shoe collection while saving you valuable floor space. ✔️【Easy Installation】The simple structure and classic design make it convenient for you to assemble and disassemble. This shoe cabinet comes with a handy hammer, mounting tools, enough connectors, and installation instructions to help you assemble it quickly and conveniently. Use the supplied hammer to tightly connect the plastic panels and connectors to ensure stability. Safe for children and adults. Size: 31.5\" (L) x 12.6\" (W) x 49.2\" (H). Maximum load capacity of each cube: 11lbs (5kg).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7178AJiOoSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NiHome","source_asin":"B09ZLHB5M4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZLHB5M4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZLHB5M4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
