window.products.push({"id":636222,"name":"AerWo White Wedding Card Box with Lock and String Light, PVC Card Box for Wedding Decorations for Reception, Wedding Memory Money Box for Wedding Rece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819M52cTYsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Design: This wedding card box comes in a beautiful white color that will complement any wedding decor and give your reception a touch of elegance. The string lights adorning the card box create a romantic ambiance while illuminating the box, making it a beautiful centerpiece at your wedding reception, with different words \"cards\" or \"love\" printed on both sides. The sleek design of the box is sure to impress your guests. High-Quality and Durable Material: The White Wedding Card Box is made with high-quality PVC material that is strong and durable, ensuring that it can withstand the weight of all your wedding cards and gifts. Its thickness is up to 5mm/0.2 inches. The sturdy material also ensures the longevity of the card box, making it a valuable keepsake for years to come. PVC is also a waterproof material, ensuring that the cards and gifts are safe and secure. Large Size: The wedding box for cards and money measures 12.2 x 8.6 x 9.3 inches, is big enough to hold over 300 cards or envelopes, and it's perfect for large receptions. Card boxes come with a lock that ensures your cards and gifts remain secure throughout the reception. The lock is easy to use, and the key is provided with the card box. Packing Included: This money box is including 1 x card box, 1 x card sign, 1 x lock, 2 x keys, 1 x installation instructions, 20 rubber rings to fix the box tightly and provide a 2m light string to DIY, which you can wound into different shapes by use your imagination. Additionally, you can choose to decorate the card box with flowers, ribbons, or other embellishments, making it match your wedding theme perfectly. Versatile and Multi-Functional: Not only are these card boxes perfect for wedding receptions, but they can also be used for other special occasions such as anniversaries, graduations, and baby showers. The classic look of the box means it can fit into any event's theme, and its versatile design can be adapted to suit different occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819M52cTYsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AerWo","source_asin":"B0BPSGJG99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSGJG99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSGJG99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
