window.products.push({"id":636329,"name":"Non-Toxic High Temp Mill-Pac Black Sealant | Fireplaces, Wood, Pellet, and Gas Stoves, Direct Vent Systems, Flue Joints | Environmentally Friendly | 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JUfN7htqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Non-toxic and organically bound, IGS Industries’ Mill-Pac Black expands to form a tight seal in your fireplace or stove that will provide years of reliable service. Mill-Pac Black will not shrink or crack, and is inert to combustion byproducts. Several major wood, pellet, and gas stove appliance manufacturers specify Mill-Pac Black as their sealant of choice! Mill-Pac Black is formulated using Non-RCF refractory fibers, which eliminates OSHA and EPA concerns with the use of these raw materials. Mill-Pac Black is still rated to a 1050°F (565oC) max continuous operating temperature, and has excellent resistance to erosion by gas or wood combustion byproducts. Since Mill-Pac Black has always been formulated with an organic, non-toxic binding system, it has been considered a green product. With the elimination of RCF fibers, Mill-PAC Black is truly environmentally friendly. Typical Applications: - Fireplaces - Wood, pellet, and gas stoves - Direct vent systems - Flue joints and boxes Advantages: - Reduces sooting and whiting - Rated to 1,050°F - Does not bake onto equipment - Conforms to rough or misaligned components - Resists breakdown from acidic byproducts such as HCl, H2SO4, HNO3, NaNO2, and HF - Easy application and clean up - Mill-Pac Black is not classified as a hazardous material","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JUfN7htqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IGS Industries","source_asin":"B01L2VWIXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L2VWIXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L2VWIXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
