window.products.push({"id":636348,"name":"Amazon store for the official \"Bolo\" Rolling Knife (The Works Double Pack). This Revolutionary Kitchen Knife, Ergonomic Design & More Efficient at Min","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fJvUi2kdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material - The casing is made of ABS reinforced by our engineered design, with a soft grip overlay on both the top of the handle and the under guard so you get maximum comfort while cutting. The blade is made of 420J2 steel, tempered for maximum durability with a Rockwell hardness of 59. The rolling action is effortless due to assist bearings which are encased in the handle. Features - The ergonomic design of the patented handle allows you to use minimal force to achieve maximum cutting, avoiding stress and fatigue on your wrist and hand. Design - The bolo handle was designed so that a round blade can roll thru the casing while holding it, with the force of your hand squarely being centered on the cutting surface. No other knife has this patented feature. This is not just a pizza cutter, it's so much more. Ease of Use - Easy to roll thru ingredients such as herbs, spices, nuts, all sorts of vegetables, salad, greens and meats. Once you are finished cutting just open the casing to clean the knife. Care - Hand wash only. All high grade blades are made with a high concentration of carbon in the steel, making it not a recommended product to wash in a dishwasher. Simply open the casing, rinse the blade and casing and let dry. To sharpen, simply use a stone, apply the brake, pass the blade over the stone, release the brake and turn the blade to the next section and repeat. Quality Assurance - Meet bolo stands behind each and every \"official\" bolo sold, we carry inventory in North America and offer a official warranty on all the units and parts. Customer Service - Zinovta Brands offers full service and warranty for all of our Chef Randall products. Included in the bolo package you will have a complete instructional guide with warranty information, link to our product experience where you can get answers to all bolo questions and our web site information for more customer service. Please note Chef Randall and Bolo are the same product just different Logo's.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fJvUi2kdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bolo","source_asin":"B01MZHLUD9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZHLUD9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZHLUD9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
