window.products.push({"id":636445,"name":"Ocean Tides Shopping Bags; Reinforced, Premium, Stand Up, Heavy Duty, Collapsible Foldable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51laPmGnirL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"The Ocean Tides Heavy Duty Reusable Grocery Bags are a must have for everyone! The average US citizen uses between 350 and 500 plastic bags per year, that adds up to 100 billion plastic bags per year. Depending on the environment a plastic bag can take 15 to 1000 years to break down. Tragically we lose an estimated one million birds, 100,000 turtles, and countless other sea animals each year from ingesting plastic. There are thousands of other facts about plastic bags and how they impact our planet, we are excited that you are making the decision to convert to a more eco-friendly way to shop. We promise that you will be thrilled with your purchase. The Ocean Tides reusable grocery bags have reinforced sides and bottom. They stand up easily for loading, carrying, and unloading groceries. The bags are not only heavy duty, but a classic minimalist style. You will be noticed and praised again and again for your choice in using this quality design. These reusable bags are very versatile, consider using them for other things. Some ideas include: Beach bag, yard sale bag, small pet carrier, laundry bag, overnight bag, carry a picnic lunch, book bag, workout bag, carry your knitting projects, trick or treat bags and many other uses. For storage and transport, simply fold the bag flat. When you ready to shop or check out, the bag turns into a wonderful tote box with reinforced handles for carrying. Our bags come in classic colors and a variety of pack quantities. Blue Bag Measures: 12.8 inches High x 11.5 inches Wide x 9 inches Deep Gray Bag Measures: 11 inches High x 13 inches Wide x 10 inches Deep Choose what works best for you and your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51laPmGnirL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ocean Tides","source_asin":"B07QQNHYSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QQNHYSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QQNHYSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
