window.products.push({"id":636447,"name":"Outdepot Digital Electronic Instant Read Food Thermometer Barbecue Meat Thermometer with Collapsible Internal Probe, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hx6NUmxtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tips: Switch Units: Shift the switch under the battery cover to set the default to \"Fahrenheit\" or \"Celsius\". Note: Use screwdriver to tighten the screw properly near the battery box to avoid probe popping out. How to use: Just turn it on and insert the temperature a couple of centimeter into the food you want to know the temperature of. In a few seconds, a highly accurate temperature reading will be displayed on the built-in LCD screen. and easy to carry and store in your kitchen drawer. Product Specifications: 7.8 x 3 x 0.9 inches °F/°C switchable Response Time:4-6seconds Large LCD display, easy to read Measurement range: 58~572°F(-50~300°C) -Accuracy: ±0.1°F(between -4oF to 392oF) Hold temperature function, it will \"hold\" the temperature reading until pressed again 15 minutes Auto-off Food-safe ABS plastic case and stainless probe Notice: 1.In order to protect the child's safety, stay away from children. 2. Do not leave thermometer in oven while cooking, do not touch hot probe with bare hands. 3. Before withdrawing from food, press HOLD button. It will \"hold\" the temperature reading. 4. Wash the metal probe in soapy water. Clean thermometer by hand. Do not completely immerse in water. 5. The folding probe is with a sharp tapered end, fold away when not in use making the wireless unit a small and convenient size for your pocket or drawer. Package Included: 1 x Outdepot Digital cooking Thermometer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hx6NUmxtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Outdepot","source_asin":"B01M1S6P34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M1S6P34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M1S6P34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
