window.products.push({"id":636470,"name":"GiftsForYouNow Red Ribbon Personalized Christmas Stocking, 18.5\", Embroidered","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SacED0cTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"As Christmas day nears, and the air is filled with the smells of garland and gingerbread, make sure that your Christmas décor is up to date. Bring holiday cheer to your home this season when you hang our beautiful, festive Christmas stocking on your fireplace mantle. Each custom stocking is skillfully embroidered in gold thread and accented with satin ribbon & sequined essentials. It measures 18.5” long with the insides lined with polyester satin. We will embroider this red stocking with any name at no additional cost to give it a special touch. In addition to making a good looking Christmas decoration, this stocking can also be a unique Christmas gift. Whomever you are shopping for, this satin stocking is sure to be cherished for years to come. Your home will be warm and ready for Santa's arrival when you put these red stockings on display!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SacED0cTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GiftsForYouNow","source_asin":"B017HRM42K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017HRM42K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017HRM42K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
