window.products.push({"id":636483,"name":"Salt and Pepper Shakers Jars, Spices Seasonings Condiments Storage Box Sets with Tray (Burgundy)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J4XHv3FiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY MATERIAL These salt and pepper shakers with adjustable lids are made of high quality durable acrylic plastic. This material is long lasting and eco friendly. These salt pepper shaker sets are transparent and crystal clear thanks to the quality material that is used. These spice shakers are a great choice as a spice and seasonings set in daily use because of easy to clean and easy to use features. Box material is thick enough to protect your condiments from dirt, dust, and moisture. EASY TO USE WITH UNIQUE DESIGN This condiment and spices container set is a great helper in your kitchen or in your travels. There are 6 different sections for all kinds of condiments and seasonings. All parts have adjustable top sliding lids, so you can arrange the amount of spices, you can decide to pour or sprinkle just by sliding the lid. You can easily remove the lid and you can pour it at once. Top sliding lids make these spice organizers more convenient for measuring the amount of spices. CONVENIENT This seasoning condiment storage container tray can be used both outdoor and indoor. It is transparent so you can see the amount inside or you can easily find what you need while cooking or eating. There is classified storage so you can store different kinds of spices. This salt and pepper shaker set spice jars are compact and portable. Can be used in BBQ, camping, hiking, barbecue, picnic, and travels. You can prevent your spices from dust and moisture during outside use. HIGH CAPACITY These 6 compartments spices and seasonings set can store many kinds of condiments and seasonings such as salt, pepper, sugar, spice, corn starch, chicken and meat broth powder, thyme, rosemary, and mint. The seasoning shaker box is made of lightweight material for easy carrying. This material is safe for storing food items. You can easily remove the top lid and store your condiments in large capacity compartments. When you close the lids no moisture anymore thanks to good sealing. GREAT GIFT These transparent crystal clear barbecue seasoning storage containers spice racks are perfect gift ideas for your lovers. This is a useful and long lasting gift for Christmas and New Year's Day, Thanksgiving Day. These salt and pepper shakers with a tray can be washed in a dishwasher with low heat. No fading even after many years of use. This seasoning condiment storage container for salt sugar will keep your spices organized. With its convenient use, perfect choice for campers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J4XHv3FiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ikido","source_asin":"B091P8PWP1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091P8PWP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091P8PWP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
