window.products.push({"id":636518,"name":"VCK Air Purifier with H14 True HEPA Filter and PM2.5 Monitor, Remove 99.997% Particles like Dust Smoke Pollen Perfect for Elder,Child and Pets, Covera","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LQOSZ4ipL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐【DUAL TRUE HEPA FILTER】VCK Air Purifier with dual filter design, cleans air more effectively. H13 true HEPA can capture and reduces up to 99. 97% of 0.3 microns particles in the air, including dust particles, pet dander, pollen, and cigarette smoke. ⭐【HIGHLY EFFICIENT PURIFICATION】Air purifier could clean spaces up to 264 ft² in 30 minutes. (CADR: 117 m³/h) The two air intakes at the top and bottom provide 360° air circulation. Fit anywhere in your home/ bedroom/ room/ office. ⭐【QUIET OPERATION & SLEEP MODE】The air purifier will run more quietly (below 24dB) when you choose sleep mode. And the display will turn off after 5 seconds helping you enjoy a perfect night of sleep without the effect of light. The sleep button can also silence the key sound if pressed and held for three seconds. ⭐【MULTIPLE FUNCTION】You can choose from three different wind speeds according to your preference. The child lock function protects you from the risk of children random operating. A 12H Timer helps you save energy when you get out or went sleep. ⭐【FILTER REPLACEMENT REMINDER】If the filter needs to be changed after using the air purifier, the indicator light (NOT displayed when filter replacement is not required.) which warns to replace the filter on the control panel will turn red and flicker when the purifier has been in use for more than 2500 hours, indicating that the user needs to replace the filter.NOTE: You can buy the replacement filters (ASIN:B0BM5VP66V) from our VCK store. ⭐【FULLY CERTIFIED FOR SAFETY】The air purifier with FCC certified, ETL listed, and EPA listed. NOTE: It may seem that the airflow is restricted at certain portions of the air purifier when it is operating. This is normal. ⭐【COMPACT SIZE & EASY TO MOVE】Air purifier with the handle on the top, it can be moved easily. You can both use it on the table and set it on the floor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LQOSZ4ipL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VCK","source_asin":"B0BLHGB8ZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLHGB8ZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLHGB8ZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
