window.products.push({"id":636584,"name":"Foldable Shoe Box, Stackable Clear Shoe Storage Box - Storage Bins Shoe Container Organizer, Multifunctional storage box 12 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71noB-qxiuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Shoe Storage Boxes are stable. Since the number of our shoe boxes can be specified according to your needs, the shoe boxes are widely used. You can place the shoe box under the bed, closet, under the table and under any available space. It is not only a shoe box, but can also store items such as socks and stationery. Unique design can meet your different use needs, the foldable shoe boxes must in your family life. Convenient to use, easy assembly and disassembly. Large capacity, protects your shoes from dust and dirt. Apply different shoes, make full use of space, so that home life clean and orderly. Feature: - Combine up and down,left and right. - Closed design protects shoes - Clear door, easy to find shoes - High quality plastic material, easy to clean. - Good waterproof, can be washed directly. - DIY, you can choose the assembled shape according to your mind. Multi-Use - More than just storage shoes ►Closet These shoe boxes can be easily split into small cubes and put into your closet. It could store whether shoes or underwear. Come and try to set your own storage systerm. ►Under Bed Small size allows it to easily put under the bed with a certain height. Make use of the space under your bed. It's dustproof, waterproof and easy to clean.Try to use it! ►Daily necessities It can also be placed on your washstand with daily cleaning products to protect them from dust and water droplets. ►Store Toys It can also be used to store some children's small toys. If the toys need to be displayed, put it into this storage shoe box. It has clear door and can be displayed well. Specifications: Material: plastic Color: white Quantity: 12pcs Single Size: 13(L) x 9(W) x 5(H) inch Manual * 1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71noB-qxiuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asoway","source_asin":"B08PFFPTBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PFFPTBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PFFPTBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":636585,"name":"RCA RP3765 AM/FM Dual Wake Clock Radio (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513MFPHD37L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description RCA RP-3765 AM/FM Dual Wake Clock Radio with Remote Control Amazon.com With the RCA RP3765 AM/FM Dual Wake Clock Radio with Remote Control, not only can you wake to an alarm or your favorite CD or radio station, but you can also wake up to your favorite television broadcast or weather station. A unique one-touch instant weather function also allows you to get the weather, on demand, whenever you want. Digital tuning, 11 AM/FM presets, and a high performance system with bass reflex speakers means that your favorite radio station, at high-performance sounds, is just a button away. A motorize CD door system provides for smooth and easy access to your favorite CD. Best of all, the RCA RP3765 runs on a unique ASIC chip, in which three features are combined to make life a little bit easier for you and yours. The Graduwake Ramp-Up Alarm gradually increases the volume of the alarm as you wake up; a \"nap\" function allows you to take a refreshing cat nap without fear of sleeping all afternoon, and a programmable snooze feature means you can sleep for up to an extra two hours after your alarm initially wakes you up. A large, backlit 1.25-inch display for easy readability rounds out the features of this outstanding CD clock radio.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513MFPHD37L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RCA","source_asin":"B0007CP68M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007CP68M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007CP68M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":636586,"name":"Metal Wall Art, Modern Home Decor, Abstract Artwork Sculpture- 47\" Echo 3 Blues by Miles Shay","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bm5Y1lEOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This piece is perfect to add elegance and sophistication to any room. If you are looking for a dynamic, three-dimensional piece of art that will energize your home, office, or garden- this is IT!. Also makes a great gift! The details hand sanded into this Abstract Metal Wall Art & Sculpture capture the interplay of the highlights and shadows and creates a three dimensional sense of movement as you view it from different angles. Pictures do not do it justice since the highlights and shadows change as you move around it. I hand polish and grind the textures into the metal to create dramatic illusions of depth and dimension. The silver reflections will be especially appreciated in person as you and your guests marvel as the brilliant glimmering light seems to interact with the metal as you move around it. Each piece is meticulously fabricated when the order is placed and will vary slightly from the photos shown (The new pieces always look better than the photos). I use the highest grade materials to bring many years of enjoyment and mounting brackets are installed to allow hanging on any surface. It usually takes about 7-10 working days to create the piece and allow it to dry completely before shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bm5Y1lEOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miles Shay","source_asin":"B00JIC7HWU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JIC7HWU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JIC7HWU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":636587,"name":"Coffee Cups Ceramic, 12 OZ Ceramic Coffee Mug with Lid and Stainless Steel Spoon, Ceramic Mug for Tea Latte Cappuccino Hot Chocolate, Ceramic Coffee M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ibTOBBoeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Ceramics】This 12 oz ceramic coffee mug with lid is made of high quality, sturdy and durable ceramics. This ceramic coffee mug 12 oz with humanized handle provides you the most comfortable grip, smooth rim makes you drink comfortably and the stable base is safe for daily using. Dishwasher safe and microwavable coffee mug with lid. 【Suitable Capacity】Height: 4.8 inches/Top Diameter: 3.2 inches /Bottom Diameter: 2.7 inches. This coffee mug with lid and handle holds up to 12 ounces of your favorite hot or cold beverage. This ceramic cups for coffee, tea, latte, cappuccino, hot chocolate. Enjoy every moment and each sip of tea with this marbling ceramic coffee mug with lid 12 oz. 【Multiple Uses】This ceramic coffee cups with lids 12 oz is designed for home and office daily use, it can be used perfectly in all occasions, such as parties, picnics, family reunion parties and other events. This coffee cups with lids and handle can be also used for storing small items around home and office. 【Ideal Gift】It makes a great gift, whether it’s for couple, mom, dad, grandma, grandpa, sister, friends, teacher and boss, this 12 oz ceramic tea cup with lid will be loved as a unique gift idea for birthdays, father's day, wedding, engagement and retirement. Each marbling ceramic tea mug with lid is handmade, so each mug pattern is unique. Let it be your exclusive gift. 【Quality Packaging】This ceramic coffee cups 12 oz is securely packaged in protective styrofoam inside box. But items may be broken during shipment. If you have any problem with the office coffee mugs after receiving, don't hesitate to contact us for a replacement or refund. At GALASALA, we are dedicated to providing high-quality products and satisfying our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ibTOBBoeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GALASALA","source_asin":"B09XV5CSQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XV5CSQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XV5CSQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
