window.products.push({"id":636813,"name":"Prasiolite Quartz Pebbles Green Amethyst Gemstone Crystal Mineral Cabs Polished Natural Sparkling Tumbled Stone Cabochon Specimens - India (5PCS)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dUsG3L0KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will get 5 pcs of the Green Prasiolite Quartz Pebbles similar to the ones in the listing, the size and the color of the cabochon may slightly vary as well due to the fact that all minerals are different. (Bowl NOT included!) Average 1 Pebble Size: 25 x 23 x 18 mm / 1 x 15/16 x 11/16 Inches; Average 1 pebble weight: 16-33g / 0.5-1.1oz; Prasiolite is a transparent green quartz. It is sometimes called green amethyst, amegreen or vermarine. Usually amethyst turns yellow, orange, or brown when heated, in part due to the formation of iron oxides. Iron compounds with Fe3+ ions are often yellow or orange, whereas Fe2+ compounds are green. It has been suggested that reducing environments (as opposed to oxidizing ones) lead either to the formation of amethyst that turns green upon heating or to the direct formation of prasiolite. Chemical Formula: SiO2; Hardness: 7-Hardness; Color: Green; Prasiolite (Greek - leek-green stone) is a rare stone in nature. Prasiolite is a transparent to translucent quartz variety, although clear gem quality material is usually produced artificially from amethyst. The color varies from a pale gray green to a deep grass green. (The above information is provided solely for informational purpose. Kindly note that all stones are offered for decorative purposes only. Please, handle your stones with great care, do not grind or crumble them, do not dip or add them into your food or drink, do not use any parts of them in any elixirs, potions, lotions etc. Always make sure you wash your hands before and after working with your crystals.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dUsG3L0KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HQRP","source_asin":"B07TBL3V2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TBL3V2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TBL3V2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
