window.products.push({"id":636846,"name":"Ceramic Candle Warmer Electric with Safety Timer | 2-in-1 Automatic Plug in Fragrance Warmer for Scented Wax Melts and Jar Candles | Decorative Air Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HZPq1lI6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLAMELESS ALTERNATIVE TO CANDLES – Electric wax warmers are a safer and cleaner alternative to burning traditional candles. Simply warm your own scented wax melts in the warmer cup to fill your room with fragrance. Smokeless, flameless, and easy to use. WARMS BOTH JAR CANDLES & SCENTED WAX – Use the removable top dish with wax chips and melts, or remove the tray and use the heating element to warm a scented candle jar. It will evenly melt wax and extend the life of your candle. PREMIUM TIMER WITH MULTIPLE SETTINGS – This candle wax warmer comes with a safety timer on the cord so you can set it to always on, or automatically turn off in 2, 4, or 6 hours. You can also adjust the power levels between low, medium, and high for varying intensities of fragrance. DECORATIVE CERAMIC WAX WARMER – This candle warmer provides quality function without compromising its looks! Featuring a ceramic construction with an embossed pattern for decorating and texture. Finished in a glossy tan glaze. ATTRACTIVE AIR FRESHENER – Decorative and functional, this unique air freshener makes a wonderful accent to any room of the home. Great for home living rooms, bedrooms, offices, yoga studios, spas and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HZPq1lI6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JULIE ANN HOME","source_asin":"B09QD3JQXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QD3JQXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QD3JQXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":636847,"name":"SURTOP 3500mAh 25.2V V10 Replacement Battery for V10 Absolute Animal Motorhead N009 Compatible for v10 Absolute Cordless Vacuum Handheld Cleaner for V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tIxCM4bjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Suit for All V10 Series Models: V10 Absolute, V10 Animal, V10 Motorhead Charging Indicator: 1.Charging status: NO.1-2-3 lights, blue flashing. 2.Fully charged status: NO.1-2-3 lights off. 3.The remaining power: The NO.1-2-3 bule light shows that the remaining power .Similar to the power indicator of the power bank. 4. When the battery is almost dead: blue light, flashing. Need special attention: 1. No. 3 Light: The red light is on and the battery stops running, indicating high temperature. The general situation is that the battery temperature is too high just after using the battery. Recommendation: After the battery temperature drops, can recharge it. 2. No. 4 Light: The white light flashes and the battery stops running, indicating that the pipe is blocked. Recommendation: Dredge the pipeline. 3. No. 5 Light: The white light flashes and the battery stops running, indicating that the HEPA Filters is not installed. Recommendation: After installing HEPA Filters, re-use it. 3500mAh, Higher Capacity, Longer Duration. No Power? 1. Make sure your battery has charge. 2. Check the battery casing isn't cracked or damaged. 3. Make sure machine’s airway isn’t blocked. Warning Tips: 1. Always remove battery pack form your tool when you are assembling parts, making adjustments, cleaning or when not being used for an extended time. 2. If you don't plan on using the Power Tool Battery for a month or more, store it in a clean, dry, cool place away from heat and metal objects. 3. Ni-Cd, Ni-MH and Li-ion batteries will self-discharge during storage; remember to recharge the batteries before use. 4. Do not leave the battery dormant for long periods of time. We recommend using the battery at least once every two to three weeks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tIxCM4bjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORHFS","source_asin":"B089YQN98J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089YQN98J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089YQN98J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
