window.products.push({"id":636868,"name":"Olamtai St Patricks Day Window Clings for Glass Windows, Shamrock Window Stickers Clings, Hat Shoes Gold Coins Decal Irish Stickers, St Patricks Day W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716lDkzYjGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to apply window clings? 1. Make sure the surface is laminated and glossy like mirror. Please don't choose rough surface like dust wall.  2. Starting out by cleaning the surface.Make sure it's clear of dust or debris that could poke through the static clings. Here is a little tip. If you apply a thin film of soapy water on the surface, it will make the rest of the process a lot easier.  3. Apply these window clings onto surface and slide into position.  4. Squeeze out water and bubbles.  5. Dry off any excess liquid on the surface and clings.  6.Apply these window clings inside of house and keep them out of the weather, so it can have more longevity for longer time of period. Features: Wide range of application: The static window stickers can be applied on most smooth surface, such as glass doors, shop windows, kitchen or bathroom tiles, which look cute and beautiful, using these beautiful stickers to decorate your home will increase more St. Patrick's Day atmosphere.  Reliable materials: These St. Patrick's Day window stickers are made of non-stick, detachable and static PVC, which can quickly decorate your windows or glass doors, even mirrors, be easily removed and will not leave glue on your window. Specifications: Material: PVC Size: as picture shown Color: as picture shown Quantity: 60 pieces (9 sheets) St. Patrick's Day window clings St. Patrick's Day Decorations Set St. Patrick's Day footprint clings St. Patrick's Day garland Perfect for St. Patrick's Day party Add vigor and vitality","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716lDkzYjGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLAMTAI","source_asin":"B08RDGBBJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RDGBBJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RDGBBJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
