window.products.push({"id":636914,"name":"Eye Candy Premium Mica Powder Pigment “Kihada Yellow” (50g) Multipurpose DIY Arts and Crafts Additive | Woodworking, Epoxy, Resin, Natural Bath Bombs,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T4QgaVPNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ MULTIPURPOSE YELLOW MICA POWDER – A light yellow titanium dioxide, this mica mineral powder is ideal for DIY craft use, such as plastics, slime making, homemade bath bombs and jewelry, melt & pour, lip balm, acrylic painting, screen printing, candle making, and more. ✅ ULTRA-FINE PURITY – Eye Candy mica pearls are 10-60 microns in size to better blend with resins, lacquer, epoxy, nail polish, latex, cosmetics, automotive paint, lotions, creams, polymer clay, varnishes, glazes, and other personal use items. ✅ ULTIMATE CRAFTING VERSALITY – Our yellow mica powder can be used for tinting, darkening, or brightening other mica colors making it ideal for use as a personal or professional soap colorant or candle making ingredient. ✅ YELLOW RESIN EPOXY FOR WOOD PROJECTS AND RESIN ART – Limitless possibilities using our colors. Whether you are making coasters, geode art, river tables, epoxy countertops, epoxy floors, coasters, and any other epoxy resin projects. Our mica pigments will meet those requirements. ✅ SAFE, NON-TOXIC, CRUELTY FREE – Kihada Yellow and all our resin color pigment is stain-free but recommend using POLYSORBATE 80 for those making bath bombs, gentle on skin, and won’t cause irritation. As with any additive, always test a small area before full use to ensure it’s allergy safe. ✅ UNBEATABLE QUALITY AND CUSTOMER SERVICE - Unbeatable Quality and Customer Service – Eye Candy mica pearls are backed by superior quality assurance, purity, and fast, responsive support. Contact us with any questions or concerns to get reliable service you can count on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T4QgaVPNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eye Candy","source_asin":"B088BBDKZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088BBDKZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088BBDKZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":636915,"name":"SUNNYPARK Christmas Tree Stand for Live Tree, Adjustable Metal Tree Holder for Real Christmas Tree fits up to 8.5 Ft, Metal Christmas Tree Stand Base ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uXcj8hYHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Outstanding Christmas Tree Stands】Every part of getting and decorating a Christmas tree should be fun, even putting it in its stand. The stand is constructed of metal for durability and years of use and has a spike inside base to offer extra security. It provides you with a sturdy support to keep your tree upright at all times and brings a touch of glamour to your Christmas décor. 【Suitable Size】Capable of supporting trees up to approximately 8.5 feet tall with strong eye screws that can be adjusted to accommodate trunks of a variety of sizes. 5.3 inch tall cylinder base is enough higher to holds a tree up, and it helps to keep your tree fresher for longer as a watertight base holder. Breaks the xmas tree stand down for easy storage throughout the rest of the year. 【Installation】Inserted a freshly cut Christmas tree into this Christmas tree stand cylinder. Make sure the tree is properly centered and as close to plumb as possible, then tighten 3 massive brass-plated eye screws. Each flange nut on the end of each screw provides firm, well-distributed pressure and prevents the screw from digging into the tree’s bark. 【Material & Structure】This Christmas Tree Stand fits snugly around your tree. It made from durable material with waterproof coating. 3 rhombic-shaped structure legs made from a robust, durable iron to create a stable and secure base for real trees. The weight of your tree is easily distributed over these 3 legs, minimising any chance of toppling or slanting. 【Get Metal Christmas Tree Stand Now!】Tired of your Christmas tree falling over and breaking your priceless family Christmas Tree Ornaments? Don't settle for a weak undersized plastic Christmas Tree Stand for a live Christmas tree. Choose the real Christmas tree stand from red, black, green or gold finishes to match your other decorations. It will make post-holiday cleanup quick and painless.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uXcj8hYHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNYPARK","source_asin":"B096XHKTSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096XHKTSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096XHKTSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
