window.products.push({"id":636971,"name":"Parisloft Where You Go I Will Go Where You Stay I Will Stay Wood Block Signs, Freestanding Wood Home Decorations for Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zYpx8vNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Parisloft, founded in 2016, we have our own factory and a designer team. We dedicate to only bring the most lovely premium quality items to your life in a lovely price. Customer satisfaction is always the first and top pursuit. This block sign is made of real wood, it has a slightly distressed background with black lettering-Where you go ,I will you, where you stay, I will stay. Sign measures approx. 11.8''x1.5''x3.8'',can be displayed on a mantle or shelf or just hang on the wall with pre-mounted hanger. It is perfect to be a great gift for housewarming,anniversary, weedings, Christmas for your special someone.Note:slight color variation is possable due to different shooting angle and different production batches.Please make your choices carefully.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zYpx8vNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parisloft","source_asin":"B07NGWRW3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NGWRW3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NGWRW3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":636972,"name":"L’il Sucker Fish Suction Rings Cup Drink Coaster Holders 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MLG+QHEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FISH THEMED CAN HOLDERS – Get the ultimate catch with the L’il Sucker Fish Rings, the perfect outdoor drink holders for your next fishing day featuring 2 fish themed designs. Mix and match your suction cup can holder depending on your mood or help a buddy out with this two pack of Lil Sucker drink holders. CUP HOLDER COASTERS: keep your drinks safe and secure with our unique Lil Sucker anti spill cup holder. Made of durable Neoprene, your drink will be kept firmly in place. It is uniquely designed to stick to any flat non-porous surface such as metal, glass, plastic and wood, perfect for both the outdoors and indoors. Use on boats, paddleboards and in vehicles, plus office desks, coffee tables, baby highchairs and fold-down tables on flights and bus trips. SUCTION RINGS: Perfect as a stocking stuffer this Christmas, or as a practical treat for yourself! The Lil suckers suction cup holder means you will never spill a sip. The ultimate solution to spillages and accidents, the beverage suction holder fits every container you can think of (up to 3 inches in diameter). From the coffee cup on your desk to your toddler's sippy cup/baby's bottle on a highchair, or the cold can by your barbeque. EASY TO USE: Simply slide Lil suckers suction ring onto your drink, this includes cans, beer/soda bottles, tumblers and small flasks. Apply from the bottom up, set it down on any smooth surface and you are good to go with our ant-tip cup holder. When you are ready to drink, simply lift up one side and then re-suction it to the surface when you are finished drinking. VERSATILE CUP HOLDERS: These L'il Suckers can holders are usable on any flat surface, even with a L'il texture the anti spill drinks holder works effectively to prevent any accidents, in the office, at home, and in the great outdoors. Available in many different designs and colours, you can personalise your spill proof drinking experience to the max with L'il Suckers drink holder. WHY LIL SUCKER?: Our patented technology is one of a kind and adaptable to your every need, made with recyclable and dependable Neoprene, they are lightweight, fit in your pocket or bag and are hand wash friendly. Whether you are travelling with your Lil suckers, use them to keep your drinks stable in the house or keep your can/flask upright whilst flying by on a boat, we have you covered!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MLG+QHEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lilsucker","source_asin":"B06XR6M8DV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XR6M8DV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XR6M8DV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":636973,"name":"Watercolor World Map II by Michael Tompsett, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g0flTjtxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a watercolor world map. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs.  Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g0flTjtxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLYLDS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-636973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLYLDS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLYLDS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
